<title>USA: Alliance formed by Hinsdale-Liberty merger.</title>
<headline>Alliance formed by Hinsdale-Liberty merger.</headline>
<dateline>HINSDALE, Ill. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hinsdale Financial Corp and Liberty Bancorp Inc on Monday said they completed their merger, forming a combined company called Alliance Bancorp.</p>
<p>Alliance stock will begin trading on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;ABCL&quot; on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The new $1.3 billion asset bank holding company said it intended to pay a quarterly cash dividend at an annual rate of $0.65 a common share.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
